# --- Large binaries that belong in a release, not in the repository ----------
# Figure exports are committed as PNG and PDF. EPS and TIFF are produced by
# stage 15 and attached to the Zenodo release instead, so that the repository
# stays small enough to clone.
# Uncomment the next two lines to keep them out of git entirely:
# results/figures/*.eps
# results/figures/*.tif
